    "en": "literally «the son of a stone»",
    "tr": "lafzen «taşın oğlu»"
   },
   "note": {
    "en": "A name built as an idafa: ابْنُ carries the case of its seat, and حَجَرٍ is always in jarr — a three-letter masculine name, so it keeps its tanwin.",
